            "review_title": "Review at Con Bo Map",
            "review_text": "StEw_VN\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam81 contributions\n1\nOrdered a large cheeseburger\nFeb 2020\nOrdered a large cheeseburger combo and a regular swiss burger. The large burger is supposed to have 150g, the regular 100g. \n\nWhen the burgers arrived the burgers were the same size, the regular one even a bit bigger. \n\nWe addressed this to the restaurant and no one cared. They said the burgers are different size. \n\nWe normally do not mind mistakes and these things happen. But when the restaurant does not care, we think this is not acceptable. \n\nThe service and reply should improve.\nRead more\nWritten February 29, 2020",
