            "review_title": "Review at Con Bo Map",
            "review_text": "DanCarmo\nSan Antonio, Texas27 contributions\n0\nI ate here three times in a week!\nOct 2019\nThere are a few places to get a good burger in HCMC but not many near Vinhoms Central Park - if you order at drive time or early a weekend night it's gonna take a while that's just the nature of traffic especially if it's raining. \n\nBut I had the bacon cheddar all three times so I can't vouch for much except to say it was goof enough the first time so I stuck with it...the bread had a croissant kinda flavor, sliced tomato pickles and bacon are fresh but the mayo they put on there adds a real nice flavor to it. Ozzy beef is what it is but the patty was above par for the city. The fries were fantastic but they do come un-spiced un-salted so you should request some because as fresh cut fries they need some S&P for sure.\n\nI had extended stay at VH and it had been a couple weeks since I had western food and this hit the spot. I believe I ordered right at 4pm and it was downstairs at 4:20...the last time. First time they did tell me they were slammed (Saturday night) but it arrived warm and fresh. Second time I took a motorbike to the cafe and ate it there.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 10, 2019",
