            "review_title": "Review at Con Bo Map",
            "review_text": "VungerLongTime\nVung Tau, Vietnam17 contributions\n0\nGreat delivery burger and fries\nDec 2017 • Solo\nBurger came so fast that the beef was nice and hot, cheese melted, and yet the lettuce, onion, pickle, and tomato still a bit crisp and fresh. Well cooked, nicely-seasoned and textured beef, and a generous portion of bacon. Big size over all, though the patty is not too thick (which I actually prefer). Tasty bun, not that overly-sweet bread you get so often in VN. The french fries were crisp outside, creamy inside, and each fry was big and the total portion was, too. Canned drink was ice-cold. For fast delivery and for about 200k all in, I was well pleased wit this.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 14, 2017",
