            "review_text": "katanankes\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam90 contributions\n1\nThey need to improve service\nMay 2016 • Solo\nI was very eager to experiment this new place Con Bo Map (that in Vietnamese means Mad Cow if I am not mistaken) just around the corner where I live. I already had tried the location in District 1 that left me unimpressed and upset about the service level. \n\nThe food again is ok, but the portions are quite small (so do not get duped by the seemingly good prices, it is less for less). What pissed me off again was waiting half an hour with the place half empty for a simple English breakfast. I am leaving this as constructive feedback. If they could improve lead time and offer bigger dishes it would be actually a good place for breakfast.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 29, 2016",
